  "changelog": "- Initial release of the psychology-research-designer skill.\n- Transforms research interests or drafts into coherent, actionable, and testable psychology research designs.\n- Supports various research stages (from vague interest to near-complete design) and identifies user\u2019s current progress.\n- Offers multiple modes: quick, deep, standard, and review, each with clear outputs and rules.\n- Enforces strict guidelines against fabricating measures, references, statistical misreporting, and over-interpreting results.\n- Includes detailed workflows for variable definition, operationalization, design comparison, audit, and risk review.",
